# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002505> (has intermediate)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002505> "'lysine biosynthetic process via diaminopimelate' SubClassOf has_intermediate some diaminopimelate")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002505> "p has intermediate c if and only if p has parts p1, p2 and p1 has output c, and p2 has input c")
